  "name": "Zul'Gurub: Mythic Mar'li hunts for 21 s after her Burrow and burrows every 58 s",
  "contract": [
    "In the CoA Mythic log of 2026-08-04 Mar'li's (14510) spider cycle of Web Spray, Burrow (2118140) and Poison",
    "Shock (2118145) comes every 58.5 s, against 45-46 s in the Normal logs, and Bronzebeard Ascended of 2025-12-21",
    "gives 56-58 s; the round-5 change uses 58 s on Mythic and Ascended. Poison Shock starts about 1.8 s after she",
    "comes up (both logs), and on Mythic she then stays on non-tanks for 12-19 s before the tank gets her back.",
    "The hunt therefore lasts 21 s from the emerge on Mythic and Ascended (Normal and Heroic keep the tester's 8 s).",
    "A Mythic group of a tank and an archer about 30 yards away fights her. After the first Burrow she must come up",
    "on the archer with Menacing Gaze (2118141), cast Poison Shock, still hold the archer 12 s after coming up",
    "(the 8 s hunt would be over), let go and return to the tank, and not burrow again before 50 s have passed",
    "since the first Burrow, then burrow again within 62 s."
  ],
